2. Import and register the plugin in your project's main app file:

```javascript
import { BottomSheetPlugin } from '@nativescript-community/ui-bottomsheet/vue';
import Vue from 'nativescript-vue';
...
// Register the Vue plugin
Vue.use(BottomSheetPlugin);
```

